# Copy to `.env` (or `.env.local`) and adjust for your environment.
# Vite only exposes variables prefixed with VITE_ to the browser bundle.

# Leave unset in local Vite dev so the UI calls `/api` on the same origin
# and the Vite proxy forwards it to FastAPI (see vite.config.ts).
# Set this only when the API is on a different host than the UI.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000

# Optional. Defaults to VITE_API_BASE_URL with `http` swapped for `ws`,
# which is correct for local development and for any deployment where the
# WebSocket is served from the same host as the API.
# VITE_WS_URL=wss://api.example.org
